  "translation": "Ɔba barima, ɔbaa ba a ɔfiri Dan mma mu, na ne papa yɛ Tsor barima; ɔnim sɛnea wɔyɛ adwuma wɔ sikakɔkɔɔ mu, ne dwetɛ mu, kɔkɔɔ dɔkɔdɔkɔ (kalgɔn) mu, dadeɛ mu, aboɔ mu, ne dua mu, wɔ argaman ⟨hyɛnmu kɔkɔɔ⟩ mu, wɔ tekhelet ⟨tuntum nnuruamu⟩ mu, wɔ bus ⟨linen foforɔ⟩ mu, ne karmil ⟨kokooiniɔ kɔkɔɔ⟩ mu; na ɔtumi twee biribiara a wɔatwe so adwene mu, na ɔyɛ nhyehyɛeɛ biara a wɔde bɛma no, ne wo nyansafoɔ ne wo wura Adonai Dawid wo papa nyansafoɔ nom.",
